                    <value>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, &amp;quot;Fira Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Droid Sans&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(254, 112, 3);&quot;&gt;Quote Line has PSG Restricted Product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</value>
